# Build outputs of the inventory dashboard pipeline.
#
# inventory_data.json and inventory.html ARE committed — they are the snapshot
# the dashboard serves, and the sibling performance dashboard commits its
# data.json the same way. These two are regenerated on every refresh and would
# add roughly a megabyte to history per day for nothing:
#
#   raw/                     raw Shopify pulls; inputs to build_inventory_data.py
#   inventory_artifact.html  derived from inventory.html by build_artifact.py
dashboard/raw/
dashboard/inventory_artifact.html
